HI-TECH College Staff & Student Portal — Code Implementation
We will begin with the actual frontend foundation for both portals, using React + TypeScript + Vite inside hitech-college-website/apps/web.

This first code slice includes:
- Shared portal shell.
- Staff dashboard.
- Student dashboard.
- Responsive desktop sidebar.
- Mobile bottom navigation.
- Mobile menu drawer.
- Role-specific menus.
- Dashboard statistic cards.
- Timetable and upcoming activities.
- Quick actions.
- Notifications.
- Accessible navigation.
- Blue, red and cream HI-TECH theme.
- Reusable components for subsequent modules.
Slice 1 — Shared portal UI and dashboards

This is a starter implementation, not yet integrated or verified against the actual repository files. Existing components, packages and routes must be reconciled before replacing them.
